{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17947","headline":"北极赠李观 · 韩愈","name":"北极赠李观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北极有羁羽，南溟有沈鳞。\n川源浩浩隔，影响两无因。\n风云一朝会，变化成一身。\n谁言道里远，感激疾如神。\n我年二十五，求友昧其人。\n哀歌西京市，乃与夫子亲。\n所尚苟同趋，贤愚岂异伦。\n方爲金石姿，万世无缁磷。\n无爲儿女态，憔悴悲贱贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}